{"message":"I can help with this, but I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide any 2 of these 4 items: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address on file.

Based on the account information available, the Bluest Account appears to offer the strongest checking benefits, including 2.25% APY, a dedicated personal banker, up to $50 in monthly ATM-fee rebates, 10 free domestic outgoing wires monthly, and no-fee stop payments. Its linked savings boosts are limited to Silver and Bronze Savings Accounts.

For your $25,000 savings, the Gold Plus Account requires a $10,000 opening deposit and a $25,000 minimum balance. Its base APY and applicable bonuses will need to be confirmed against your eligibility and any linked products. Please also confirm whether you want the full $25,000 transferred into the new savings account immediately, and whether you prefer Bluest Account or another checking option focused on different benefits."}

